  "notes": "The subject begins with an active ordinary object-class attribute subscription containing two adapter-selected attributes. It invokes the separate standard whole-class unsubscribe service. A fresh standard MIM subscription query must return the zero-class object-class-subscription NULL response and omit the class, active, update-rate, and attribute-list parameters. The ordinary interaction and directed-interaction reports are also checked as unchanged NULL responses. The case excludes DDM and regions and does not claim full provider conformance.",
